{"id":"452216","name":"美容养颜鲜虾冬瓜汤","author":"糖小田yuan","authorId":"11133044","desc":"","cover":"images/452216/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"冬瓜","amount":"500克"},{"name":"鲜虾","amount":"6只"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"8克"},{"name":"盐","amount":"1.5克"}],"sub":[{"name":"清水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备食材。虾去虾线洗净。冬瓜去皮去瓤洗净切片。","img":"images/452216/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"锅中倒入玉米油，开小火。","img":"images/452216/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"油温七成热放入虾仁炒红。","img":"images/452216/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入冬瓜翻炒均匀。","img":"images/452216/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入生抽翻炒均匀。","img":"images/452216/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入清水开大火煮开。","img":"images/452216/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入盐再煮2分钟左右即可。","img":"images/452216/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"盛碗开喝吧。","img":"images/452216/step_8.jpeg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/452216/step_9.jpeg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/452216/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"盐的用量根据自己口味添加，虾也可以多放几只的。\n建议少做，一次喝完呦~ \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}